Core\Encoding::encodeText(): `Core\Charset::Ascii` has no spelling for 'é' (U+00E9) at offset 33 of "zzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzz…" — it is exact or it throws, and there is no transliterating or ignoring mode
